{"id":"23afff2411185eaa","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-first-order-language.md","title":"一阶语言与函数签名","display":"df-first-order-language — 一阶语言与函数签名","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-first-order-language","aliases":["56-df-first-order-language"],"display":"df-first-order-language — 一阶语言与函数签名","depends_on":[],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-first-order-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-first-order-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-language — 一阶语言与函数签名"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_L,P_L,\\mathcal V\">\\(F_L,P_L,\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为两两不交的符号集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_L\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(F_L\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 可数无限。给定元数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}_L:F_L\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}_L:F_L\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}_P:P_L\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}_P:P_L\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。等号是逻辑符号，不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_L\">\\(P_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L\\coloneqq(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L),\\qquad L\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_L\\coloneqq(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L),\\qquad L\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathrm{Const}}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in F_L:\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)=0\\},\\qquad L_{\\mathrm{Func}}\\coloneqq F_L,\\qquad L_{\\mathrm{Rel}}\\coloneqq P_L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_{\\mathrm{Const}}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in F_L:\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)=0\\},\\qquad L_{\\mathrm{Func}}\\coloneqq F_L,\\qquad L_{\\mathrm{Rel}}\\coloneqq P_L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点是为既有通用逻辑条目补建的辅助语言约定；原书重写主体使用仅含函数符号的签名。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_L=\\varnothing\">\\(P_L=\\varnothing\\)</span> 即得到等式语言。常元统一看作零元函数，消除旧文空右端与无元数的占位定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F_L,P_L,\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"F_L\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}_L:F_L\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}_P:P_L\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L\\coloneqq(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L),\\qquad L\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P).","display":true},{"tex":"L_{\\mathrm{Const}}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in F_L:\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)=0\\},\\qquad L_{\\mathrm{Func}}\\coloneqq F_L,\\qquad L_{\\mathrm{Rel}}\\coloneqq P_L.","display":true},{"tex":"P_L=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1303,"backlinks":[{"id":"06f27abe4d7ff714","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$ 为 [[56-df-first-order-language]] 的语言，$T=\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)$ 见 [[56-df-term]]。"},{"id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定语言 $L=((F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L),P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，见 [[56-df-first-order-language]]。$A,I,J$ 为集合参数，$\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)$。零元笛卡儿积 $A^0=\\{()\\}$。"},{"id":"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\operatorname{ar}_P)$ 为 [[56-df-first-order-language]] 的一阶语言，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L)$ 为其函数符号签名。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-first-order-language.md]]"}],"outgoing":[]}